      "text": "{\"verdicts\":[{\"n\":1,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:3333-3333\"],\"reason\":\"make_class builds the class exactly with `types.new_class(name, bases, {}, lambda ns: ns.update(body))`.\"},{\"n\":2,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:416-420\"],\"reason\":\"In the auto_attribs branch, a class-body value whose class is not `_CountingAttr` is wrapped via `a = attrib(a)`, where the first positional parameter of `attrib` is `default`.\"},{\"n\":3,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:2230-2230\",\"src/attr/_make.py:2379-2384\"],\"reason\":\"`annotations` is initialized to `{\\\"return\\\": None}` and entries are only added from `a.type` (or a converter's annotated first param), so untyped fields leave it unchanged.\"},{\"n\":4,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1523-1527\"],\"reason\":\"`if kw_only:` gates the choice between FORCE/YES (based on force_kw_only), with NO otherwise.\"},{\"n\":5,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:806-809\"],\"reason\":\"In the slots branch of build_class, `self._cls.__attrs_base_of_slotted__ = weakref.ref(cls)` is set on the original class.\"},{\"n\":6,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:2085-2087\"],\"reason\":\"`if cls.__module__ in sys.modules: globs.update(sys.modules[cls.__module__].__dict__)` merges the module dict into the init globals.\"},{\"n\":7,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:431-439\"],\"reason\":\"The non-auto_attribs branch sorts class-dict `_CountingAttr`s with `key=lambda e: e[1].counter`.\"},{\"n\":8,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:416-416\"],\"reason\":\"The annotated-name lookup is literally `a = cd.get(attr_name, NOTHING)`.\"},{\"n\":9,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1160-1160\",\"src/attr/_make.py:1730-1739\"],\"reason\":\"`add_eq` assigns the module-level `__ne__` function to the class dict rather than generating a per-class one.\"},{\"n\":10,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_funcs.py:101-102\"],\"reason\":\"asdict uses `cf = value_type if retain_collection_types is True else list` for tuple/list/set/frozenset values.\"},{\"n\":11,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:399-402\",\"src/attr/_make.py:441-451\"],\"reason\":\"`anns = _get_annotations(cls)` runs unconditionally before the `these` branch, and `anns.get(attr_name)` is passed for every entry of ca_list.\"},{\"n\":12,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1042-1055\"],\"reason\":\"slots_setstate handles a tuple state for pre-22.2.0 pickles and otherwise only sets names that are `in state`.\"},{\"n\":13,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1339-1350\"],\"reason\":\"With flag None and auto_detect True, the function iterates over *dunders* calling `_has_own_attribute(cls, dunder)`.\"},{\"n\":14,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:772-777\",\"src/attr/_make.py:1226-1238\"],\"reason\":\"When both attributes exist, the unsafe variant is chosen, and it assigns __module__/__qualname__/__doc__ without contextlib.suppress.\"},{\"n\":15,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_funcs.py:122-144\"],\"reason\":\"Dict values are rebuilt via `df = dict_factory` with `_asdict_anything(kk, is_key=True, ...)` for keys.\"},{\"n\":16,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1595-1598\",\"src/attr/_make.py:1125-1146\",\"src/attr/_make.py:2083-2083\"],\"reason\":\"When added_init is false, add_attrs_init calls the same `_make_init_script` with attrs_init=True, which only switches the method name to `__attrs_init__`.\"},{\"n\":17,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1271-1276\",\"src/attr/_make.py:3346-3354\",\"src/attr/_next_gen.py:40-40\"],\"reason\":\"attr.s mirrors order from eq, make_class passes default_eq=True yielding order=True, whereas define defaults order=False.\"},{\"n\":18,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:2147-2149\",\"src/attr/_make.py:2099-2103\",\"src/attr/_make.py:2209-2215\"],\"reason\":\"For frozen+slots the setters are `_setattr`/`_setattr_with_converter`, which emit calls to the cached `object.__setattr__` bound via `_cached_setattr_get(self)`.\"},{\"n\":19,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:3020-3054\"],\"reason\":\"ClassProps.__init__ takes exactly the sixteen listed parameters and assigns each directly to the corresponding slot.\"},{\"n\":20,\"label\":\"supported\",\"lines\":[\"src/attr/_make.py:1948-1950\",\"src/attr/_make.py:1960-1968\"],\"reason\":\"`fields` begins with `generic_base = get_generic_base(cls)` and uses it for specialized generics.\"}]}",
